        "quote": "(d) Code Violation. Any violation of the water conservation plan shall also be considered a violation of this code and may be punishable by proceedings in Municipal Court. Each day’s violation shall constitute a separate offense and shall be punished accordingly. (Ord. 20089 § 31, 10-17-17.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.650:block:8#text",
